OL,3,GNEWSA'Mrs Christmas' hosting last      
OL,4,Adinner for those alone                 
OL,6,FA woman nicknamed "Mrs Christmas" is   
OL,7,Fgearing up to host her final annual    
OL,8,FChristmas lunch for those who would    
OL,9,Fotherwise spend the festive period     
OL,10,Falone.                                 
OL,12,FGloria Stewart, 77, has been organising
OL,13,F'Home Alone at Christmas' dinners in   
OL,14,FSheffield since 2007 and is now set to 
OL,15,Fhand over the baton due to ill health. 
OL,17,FShe brings hundreds together for a     
OL,18,Fspecial meal each year, with about 400 
OL,19,Fpeople expected to attend her final    
OL,20,FChristmas lunch in Hillsborough in     
OL,21,FDecember.                              
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
