OL,3,GNEWSA'Mrs Christmas' hosting last      
OL,4,Adinner for those alone                 
OL,6,F"I never turn anybody away," she said. 
OL,7,F"I've got a lovely family, a roof over 
OL,8,Fmy head, food in my cupboards, heating 
OL,9,Fto keep me warm.                       
